+      "caveat": "A pre-existing, unrelated Qwen3.5-9B HIP server (PID 2105253, up 1d10h, NOT started by this session and NOT killed) was resident on the iGPU throughout, so this number is contended. The pre-existing igpu_throughput.json measurement was taken under the same contention."
