+  "q8_0_vs_f16_KV_TASK_LEVEL": {
+    "why": "Finding 5: the prior artifact's KV comparison was 2 games x 512 tokens -- about 4% of the generation length a real induction needs -- so it could only say that the two arms' TEXT diverged at character 97, never whether the emitted world model differed. This is the task-level version the finding asked for.",
+    "design": "Same frozen 6-prompt corpus, same seed 5900, same temperature 0.0, same cache_prompt=False, same 16384 budget, graded on held-out transitions. n_ctx differs (q8_0 at 32768, f16 at 24576) ONLY because f16 does not fit at 32768; neither arm truncates its prompt at its own n_ctx, so KV type is the live variable.",
