+    "what_is_still_NOT_established": "This does NOT establish that Qwen is intrinsically the weaker INDUCER. On the cells where Qwen did finish, it sometimes scored well (see view A). A larger budget, or /no_think, might rescue it -- but see qwen_zero_reason_split for HOW MUCH: at most 2 of the 8 discordant games are budget-limited, and 17 of Qwen's 21 successful inductions scored 0.0 with budget to spare. So the honest claim is bounded: AT THIS BUDGET, with this mechanism, Qwen fails to deliver a usable world model on a large fraction of cells while gemma nearly always does -- and roughly half of that failure is budget, roughly half is a wrong model.",
